<title>USA: Ohio $169 mln taxable deal priced by Seasongood.</title>
<headline>Ohio $169 mln taxable deal priced by Seasongood.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seasongood &amp; Mayer said Wednesday it tentatively priced Ohio's $168.8 million taxable development assistance corp bonds, series 1996, to yield 90 basis points over comparable Treasury securities in the 2021 maturity.</p>
